    "wacc_rationale": "USD flows, USD rate. Rf 4.2% (10y UST), ERP 5.0%, beta ~1.0 -> cost of equity ~9.2%. Pre-tax cost of debt ~4.6% (A-rated; FY25 interest $1,309M on ~$32B debt = 4.1% book), ~3.6% after 22% tax. Market weights: equity ~$165B, net debt ~$28.7B -> D/V ~15%. WACC ~8.4%, used 8.25% (one rate for all scenarios; cyclicality is charged in the bear scenario and the 20% bear weight, not by a WACC premium).",
